  "blocks": [
    {
      "discriminant": "introPortraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Projekt-Intro",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/0/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "How much kitsch does a craft actually need to be perceived as authentic?\n\nWhen Lisa Kasper and Franz Honeder pitched us their vision, it was about much more than just bread: a space built on conviction, pleasure, and community, serving sourdough in the morning, focaccia at noon, and natural wine at night.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Brot",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/1/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "bakery (neu)",
        "videoFile": "/videos/brotstudio/blocks/2/value/videoFile.mp4",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "We knew that a classic, watered-down bakery branding would kill this concept instantly. Instead of mere decoration, Brotstudio needed an identity that pulls visitors right into the bakehouse, seating them directly next to the oven.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Logo",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/3/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "centeredStatement",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Stencil",
        "statement": "\n\n\n\n\n\nThe stencil makes the brand independent and sustainable.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
        "textSize": "large"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "schablone",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/5/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "Applied directly on-site, hand-stamping the bread bags right before handing them over gives the product an almost institutional seal of quality. Even in ancient Rome, stencils were used to mark loaves of bread—back then as currency and tax seals. We revived this industrial mechanism: the stenciled ‘B’ glyph isn’t a decorative logo; it’s a working tool.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Sackerl",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/6/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Wand_Design",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/7/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitNoText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "mitarbeiter",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/8/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "mobileFullWidth": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeStandard",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "heat",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/9/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Icon Text",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/10/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "A rigid logo mark would have killed the dynamic of the space. Instead, the ‘B’ acts as a constant anchor while fluidly merging with situational icons: heat symbols for the bakehouse, recycling arrows for the paper bag, jagged hand icons for the craft. The space speaks to its guests.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Icons",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/11/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "New Bread Order Text",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/12/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "Community isn’t an accessory here, it is the actual product.\n\nIt marks the difference between a place where you merely buy something and a place where you want to stay. Anyone who sits, drinks, eats, talks, laughs, or simply stays silent here helps write the character of the house. Every voice, every glass, every glance becomes part of an atmosphere that cannot be engineered and is genuine for that very reason.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeStandard",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "New Bread order Text",
        "media": "/images/content/brotstudio/blocks/13/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
